--swiftversion 6.0
--indent 4
--maxwidth 120
--exclude .build

# This codebase is a mechanical port of KataGo's C++ and is kept traceable to the
# original statement by statement (.swiftlint.yml turns off the size lints for the
# same reason). The port leans on single-line conditional bodies —
# `if !isValPass { shardIndex += 1 }` — in roughly 470 places, mirroring the C++ it
# came from. The rules below each want those split across three lines, which would
# cost that correspondence for no behavioural gain.
--disable wrapIfStatementBodies,wrapIfExpressionBodies,wrapMultilineStatementBraces
